WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.368
Oleksandra Matviichuk

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.636
Welcome to the program.

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.005
Thank you for invitation.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.840
Can I just start by asking you

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.375
about today?

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:09.476
You're in Ukraine.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.312
You have seen another wave of missiles

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:13.780
and drones attacking

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.149
civilian structures, ends up region

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.251
and in the key region.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.086
What can you tell us about this

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.888
and what does it mean in the broader

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.957
human rights picture

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:25.658
when you speak about the general

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:26.493
human cell?

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.328
It's me in that belief in total.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:30.964
Unfortunately, we can't know

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.734
whether the next air alarm started

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.303
or when Internet will disappear.

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:40.907
And when we speak about our professional

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:41.975
point of view,

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.510
it's the next war crimes

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.145
which was committed by Russians,

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:47.113
which we have to document.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.815
And how are you getting on

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.016
with documenting?

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:51.551
Because you've been doing it

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.552
in real time,

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.321
along with other organizations inside

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.623
and outside Ukraine.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:58.858
How is the documentation going?

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.062
A large scale invasion started.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.364
We united other efforts with dozens

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.333
of regional organizations, and we built

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.436
whole Ukrainian network

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.171
of local document takers.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:13.840
And that's why we are able to send

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.876
local commentators for the place of crime

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.812
when something happened

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:21.181
and they made their own photos

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.015
and videos,

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:23.383
speak with people,

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.952
collect testimonies, etc..

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:27.654
And the government, your government today

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:29.255
said that these latest attacks

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.058
are deliberate attacks against civilians.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.527
So that is a war crime, obviously.

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:36.096
And I wonder

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:39.499
how you get your documenting teams

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:42.202
to the places that are under attack.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:46.206
It's depends whether the crime

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:47.040
was committed

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.008
because Russian troops deliberately

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:49.909
shelling

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.211
residential buildings,

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:54.380
schools, churches, hospitals, attack

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.716
evacuation corridors, management,

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:58.351
Russian camp systems,

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.453
organize forcible deportations

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:02.155
and commit murder,

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:04.257
tortures, rapes, abductions

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.925
in the occupied territories.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:09.129
So when we speak about controlled part

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:11.231
or by Ukrainian government,

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:13.533
which is far from the battle zone,

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.434
it's easier

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:16.169
for us to send people

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.604
to work on the ground.

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.772
But when we speak about the limitation

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.841
on the occupied territories,

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.843
it's a very difficult job

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.612
because these people

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.347
who collect information

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.249
there can be subjected

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:31.651
to illegal detention and torture.

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:35.088
And also, Alexandra, I've heard that,

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.590
you know, even those committing

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:38.625
the crimes

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:39.459
are much less

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:42.195
the victims in the occupied regions.

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.998
Maybe many of them are dead by now.

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:47.901
Do you consider that a problem

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.670
in terms of accountability in the future?

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:52.672
It's a huge problem

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:55.441
that I am as a Ukrainian human

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.776
rights defender,

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:58.745
who have been applying

00:02:58.745 --> 00:02:59.279
the law

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:00.813
for many years

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.816
to protect people and human dignity

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.953
for current moment, have no legal tools

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:08.688
how to protect people

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:10.456
in the occupied territories.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:12.992
And people there live in a gray zone.

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.662
They have no chance

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.430
to protect their rights,

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.264
their freedom,

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.366
their property, their lives,

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.901
and they the loved ones.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.337
This means that occupation

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:27.674
is not alternative to the war is just

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:29.809
another form of this war.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:31.611
You know, we've

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:33.913
we've heard the most terrible stories

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:35.515
about children.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:37.016
The attack on children,

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:39.052
the forcible deportation of children,

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:40.954
the kidnap of children,

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.722
the indoctrination of children,

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.857
the forced adoptions of children

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:45.858
over in Russia

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:46.926
and as you know,

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:49.662
the ICC has issued a warrant

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:51.664
for the arrest of Vladimir Putin

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:52.932
and his so-called

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:55.034
commissioner for Children's Affairs.

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:58.171
And her name is Maria Elena Vova Belova.

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:02.642
Do you see this as a good first step?

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:03.643
How do you react

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:05.645
to the ICC arrest warrant?

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:09.249
I welcome this arrest warrant

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:11.651
because it's historical decision.

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:13.353
It's first in the history

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:15.221
of an international criminal court

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:18.324
issued arrest warrant from the current

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.426
head of the state,

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:23.830
which is the member of Security Council

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:24.797
of UN

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.232
and the State

00:04:26.232 --> 00:04:28.501
which has a huge nuclear potential.

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:30.570
This means that

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.438
International Criminal Court

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:34.407
emphasize violence against that.

00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:36.376
We have to live in the world

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:38.544
the rule of law dictate rules,

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:41.180
not brutal force.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.417
So I want to play a soundbite of.

00:04:44.684 --> 00:04:45.752
It was last month

00:04:45.752 --> 00:04:46.886
when this woman, Maria,

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:47.320
live over

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.788
Bolivia, was talking to Vladimir

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:52.125
Putin in the Kremlin about this

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:54.394
abduction, although she didn't

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:55.461
call it that.

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:58.564
And it was about her adopting a child

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:00.800
from Mariupol. Listen to this.

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:02.935
Did you adopt a child

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:04.604
from Mariupol yourself?

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:06.239
Yes. Thanks. To you.

00:05:06.239 --> 00:05:07.840
15 years old.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:08.975
Now I know what it means to be

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:10.777
a mother of a child from numbers.

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:12.145
It's difficult,

00:05:12.145 --> 00:05:14.180
but we definitely love each other.

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:17.684
What do you feel?

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:19.085
I just want to know your feeling

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:21.521
when you first saw that.

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:24.824
No, it's very sensitive topic for me.

00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:28.895
And for Ukrainians because it's children

00:05:29.262 --> 00:05:32.098
and this is Ukrainian children

00:05:32.098 --> 00:05:35.501
who are forcibly reeducated as Russians.

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:37.770
And in the press

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.006
release, International Criminal Court

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:41.274
qualified.

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:43.576
This action is a war crime.

00:05:43.576 --> 00:05:45.078
But I do believe

00:05:45.078 --> 00:05:46.913
that we have to prove that

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:48.214
it's much more bigger.

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:51.517
It's a component of genocide, a policy

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:53.986
which Russia imposed against Ukraine

00:05:55.054 --> 00:05:55.621
Okay.

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:57.657
That's a really huge crime,

00:05:57.657 --> 00:05:58.257
as you know, is

00:05:58.257 --> 00:05:59.292
the highest crime

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:02.128
under international law, genocide.

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:06.699
Tell me what legal route

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:07.433
do you see

00:06:07.433 --> 00:06:10.503
from those abductions to actual genocide?

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:11.738
Why do you call it that?

00:06:12.905 --> 00:06:13.773
When we

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:14.841
when we stayed there,

00:06:14.841 --> 00:06:17.343
this war has genocidal character.

00:06:17.677 --> 00:06:19.879
We know just rely upon

00:06:20.079 --> 00:06:21.647
the statement of Putin.

00:06:21.647 --> 00:06:23.082
And he's surrounding

00:06:23.082 --> 00:06:25.852
the Ukraine has no right to exist.

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:27.587
There is no Ukrainian nation.

00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:29.255
There is no Ukrainian culture.

00:06:29.255 --> 00:06:31.190
There is no Ukrainian language.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.826
But also on actual activities

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:36.129
which restaurants committed in Ukraine.

00:06:36.129 --> 00:06:36.996
It's very visible

00:06:36.996 --> 00:06:38.264
in occupied territories,

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:40.032
how they forcibly change

00:06:40.032 --> 00:06:41.634
identity of people.

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:43.803
They prohibit Ukrainian language.

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:47.607
They try to to persecute,

00:06:47.707 --> 00:06:49.342
not try but prosecute

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:52.712
people who express Ukrainian identity.

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:55.581
And in this regard, when we speak

00:06:55.882 --> 00:06:58.351
that Ukrainian children are forcibly

00:06:58.384 --> 00:07:00.420
reeducated as Russians,

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.255
it's a component of this policy

00:07:02.255 --> 00:07:03.723
because when we

00:07:03.723 --> 00:07:05.925
have this genocidal intent

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:07.193
to destroy it completely

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:08.961
or partially some ethnic group,

00:07:08.961 --> 00:07:10.296
there is no obligation

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:12.598
just to kill all members of this group.

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:15.001
You cannot just forcibly change

00:07:15.001 --> 00:07:17.203
the identity of members of the group

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:19.472
and the whole group will disappear.

00:07:19.472 --> 00:07:20.039
Alexandra,

00:07:20.039 --> 00:07:21.974
I want to ask you a personal question.

00:07:21.974 --> 00:07:24.277
As a woman, as a human rights activist

00:07:25.011 --> 00:07:26.612
trying to pursue now

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:29.315
the most intense cases of your life

00:07:29.315 --> 00:07:30.016
in your career,

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:32.885
I assume women are hugely implicated

00:07:33.419 --> 00:07:34.487
and are victims

00:07:34.487 --> 00:07:36.055
as well as children in this war,

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:38.224
and that's been foisted on your country.

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:40.393
What are your personal reflections

00:07:40.393 --> 00:07:42.962
and feelings at this moment in this war?

00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:48.568
I have two main feelings.

00:07:49.168 --> 00:07:51.571
First, I must be very honest

00:07:51.571 --> 00:07:54.574
that I am work in human rights fields.

00:07:54.574 --> 00:07:55.775
For 20 years,

00:07:55.775 --> 00:07:56.843
since nine of them,

00:07:56.843 --> 00:07:59.312
I have been documenting war crimes.

00:07:59.312 --> 00:08:01.147
I personally interviewed

00:08:01.147 --> 00:08:02.381
hundreds of people

00:08:02.381 --> 00:08:04.150
who survived Russian captivity,

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.418
and they told me

00:08:05.418 --> 00:08:06.919
horrible stories called

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:08.588
they were beaten, raped,

00:08:08.588 --> 00:08:10.623
held their fingers scarred.

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:12.992
How they were tortured was electric

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:16.596
and other kinds of horrible details.

00:08:16.963 --> 00:08:19.165
But even I,

00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:21.534
with all my experience on the ground,

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:23.035
wasn't prepared

00:08:23.035 --> 00:08:25.037
for such a level of atrocity

00:08:25.037 --> 00:08:27.707
because Russia uses war crimes,

00:08:27.907 --> 00:08:29.742
the methods of warfare,

00:08:29.742 --> 00:08:30.576
and Russia

00:08:30.576 --> 00:08:32.178
attempts to break people

00:08:32.178 --> 00:08:34.313
resistance and occupy Ukraine

00:08:34.647 --> 00:08:36.048
by inflicting

00:08:36.048 --> 00:08:38.518
immense pain on millions of people.

00:08:39.452 --> 00:08:40.786
But second,

00:08:40.786 --> 00:08:44.357
my feelings it's a feeling of love,

00:08:44.657 --> 00:08:46.092
because when large

00:08:46.092 --> 00:08:47.627
scale invasion started,

00:08:48.728 --> 00:08:50.162
it's resulted in

00:08:50.162 --> 00:08:52.031
a huge wave of solidarity

00:08:52.031 --> 00:08:54.000
among people in Ukraine.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.036
And we become witness how ordinary

00:08:57.036 --> 00:08:58.271
people started

00:08:58.271 --> 00:09:00.573
to do extraordinary things.

00:09:00.573 --> 00:09:02.642
And when international organizations

00:09:02.642 --> 00:09:04.510
evacuated, their personal,

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:06.078
ordinary people remained

00:09:06.078 --> 00:09:08.114
and start to do their work.

00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:09.849
They broke encirclement

00:09:09.849 --> 00:09:12.051
to provide humanitarian aid

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:13.953
they helped people to survive

00:09:13.953 --> 00:09:15.788
under artillery fire.

00:09:15.788 --> 00:09:19.191
They rescued people who were trapped

00:09:19.191 --> 00:09:21.460
into the rubble of residential buildings.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:23.062
Etc., etc..

00:09:23.062 --> 00:09:26.299
And now I think that we,

00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:28.401
like never before

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:30.603
have this very sharp telling.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.172
What does it mean to be a human being?

00:09:34.073 --> 00:09:34.941
Amazing.

00:09:34.941 --> 00:09:36.409
Oleksandra Matviichuk,

00:09:36.409 --> 00:09:38.411
thank you so much indeed for joining us.

00:09:39.078 --> 00:09:39.578
Thank you.

